      "The added policy assessment has real token and elapsed-time cost. It was not incorporated into runtime reservations, deadlines, metrics or configuration.",
      "Semantic correctness failures remained for multilingual names, line-separated content, exception domains and subdomains.",
      "No public package source or operator configuration was modified, and the historical 400-prompt corpus was not rescored."
    ]
  }
